#: includes/admin-page.php:1228
msgid "About Options"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1230
msgid "These settings control plugin behavior across your site. Changes take effect immediately."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1232
msgid "Clear confirmation:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1232
msgid "Controls whether a confirmation dialog appears when clearing typography formatting in the editor."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1233
msgid "Archive font detection:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1233
msgid "When enabled, the plugin scans full post content on archive pages to detect fonts. This ensures fonts load correctly but may impact performance on sites with many posts per page."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1234
msgid "Cache management:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1234
msgid "The plugin caches font detection results for performance. Clear the cache after making significant changes to fonts or content."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1239
msgid "Configure general plugin settings and user experience preferences."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1249
msgid "Admin Color Scheme"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1256
msgid "Default"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1259
msgid "Match Admin Theme"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1262
msgid "Alice Blue"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1265
msgid "Dark Mode"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1268
msgid "High Contrast"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1272
msgid "Choose a color scheme for the Typography Stylist admin page. “Match Admin Theme” uses the colors of your WordPress admin color scheme."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1278
msgid "Clear Button Confirmation"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1289
msgid "Show confirmation when clearing typography features"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1292
msgid "When enabled, the Clear button in the block editor will show a confirmation dialog before removing all formatting. This helps prevent accidental data loss. Users can disable this on a per-session basis."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1298
msgid "Enter Key in Typography Stylist Blocks"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1309
msgid "Enter adds a line break inside the block"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1312
msgid "When enabled (the default), pressing Enter inside a Typography Stylist block adds a line break to the same block, so a multi-line headline stays one block with one set of typography settings. Turn this off to match the rest of the editor, where Enter starts a new block. Shift+Enter always adds a line break either way. Existing content is not changed by this setting."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1318
msgid "Archive Page Font Detection"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1329
msgid "Check full post content on archive pages (recommended)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1332
msgid "When enabled, the plugin checks the full post content on blog archives, category pages, and tag pages to find custom fonts. The fonts then load correctly, even when posts do not have manual excerpts or “Read More” tags. The results are cached for 12 hours, so the cost is small: approximately 250–600 ms on the first page load, then less than 1 ms. Turn this off only if you have a specific performance problem, or if your theme shows plain text excerpts."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1339
msgid "WordPress Font Library"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1350
msgid "Automatically register newly uploaded fonts in the WordPress Font Library (recommended)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1353
msgid "When enabled, the plugin also registers fonts from new webfont kits in the WordPress Font Library, so WordPress can use them like any other Library font. Either way, the plugin’s --font-N variables keep working, so existing content does not change. To register fonts that you uploaded before, go to the Custom Fonts tab. You can register them one at a time or all together."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1381
msgid "Save Options"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1389
msgid "Cache Management"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1390
msgid "Typography Stylist caches font detection data for 12–24 hours to make pages faster. If fonts do not load correctly after you make changes, clear the cache here."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1396
msgid "Clear Font Cache"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1404
msgid "Editor Tips"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1405
msgid "The editor panels open with a dismissible tips notice. Dismissing it is remembered in this browser only. Use this button to show the tips again in this browser."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1410
msgid "Show Editor Tips Again"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1426
msgid "Accessibility Settings"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1429
msgid "About Accessibility"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1431
msgid "The Typography Stylist block is built for accessibility. It makes two versions of each heading: a plain text version for screen readers and a styled version for sighted readers."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-page.php:1432
